              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'>Add-to-cart Clicks: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='11'># times any item was added to the cart, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#606b76' italic='true'>attributed to an asset</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
